sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as AI Gateway<br/>FastAPI<br/>slowapi Rate Limiting
    participant Agent as Agent Server<br/>Port 8000
    participant Tracking as Tracking Server<br/>/ajax-api/3.0/*
    participant MCP as MCP Registry<br/>/{name}/*
    participant Provider as LLM Provider<br/>api.openai.com:443
    participant S3 as S3/GCS Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 1: AI Gateway - LLM Proxy Request
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth Required
    Gateway->>Gateway: Rate limit check (slowapi)<br/>Keyed by remote address
    Gateway->>Gateway: Route by endpoint name<br/>Dynamic YAML config (GatewayConfig)
    Gateway->>Provider: Proxy request<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token / API Key
    Provider-->>Gateway: LLM Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Agent: Flow 2: Agent Server - Model Invocation
    Client->>Agent: POST /invocations<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    Note right of Agent: Captures x-forwarded-access-token<br/>for downstream passthrough
    Agent->>Provider: Forward to model endpoint<br/>HTTPS/443, Passthrough Token
    Provider-->>Agent: Prediction Result
    Agent-->>Client: Inference Response

    Note over Client,Agent: Flow 3: Agent Server - Streaming Response
    Client->>Agent: POST /responses<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    Agent->>Provider: Stream request<br/>HTTPS/443
    Provider-->>Agent: Streaming chunks
    Agent-->>Client: SSE/Streaming Response

    Note over Client,Tracking: Flow 4: Tracking Server - Job Management
    Client->>Tracking: POST /ajax-api/3.0/jobs/<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    Tracking->>S3: Store artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM / GCS credentials
    S3-->>Tracking: Confirmation
    Tracking-->>Client: Job Created

    Note over Client,MCP: Flow 5: MCP Registry - CRUD Operations
    Client->>MCP: POST /{name}/versions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    MCP->>K8s: Resource operations<br/>Python SDK
    K8s-->>MCP: Confirmation
    MCP-->>Client: Version Created

    Note over Client,MCP: Flow 6: MCP Registry - Endpoint Management
    Client->>MCP: POST /{name}/endpoints<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    MCP-->>Client: Endpoint Created
    Client->>MCP: GET /{name}/endpoints<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, No Auth
    MCP-->>Client: Endpoint List

    Note over Client,Agent: Flow 7: Agent Server - Static Asset Proxy
    Client->>Agent: GET /static/*<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Agent->>Agent: SSRF protection<br/>Path allowlist + posixpath.normpath
    Note right of Agent: Proxy to local chat app<br/>localhost:3000
    Agent-->>Client: Static Asset
